{"seq":2,"slug":"flash-sale-engine","title":"秒杀引擎与库存预扣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-live-commerce/commerce/flash-sale-engine","wordCount":1218,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"秒杀引擎与库存预扣\">秒杀引擎与库存预扣</h1><p>直播间秒杀是整个直播电商技术栈中工程难度最高的模块：百万用户在同一秒点击购买，争夺有限库存（有时只有 100 件）。这是一个极致的高并发写请求场景，稍有不慎就会超卖（卖出多于实际库存）、系统崩溃或用户体验极差。秒杀引擎的工程目标是：<strong>在严格防超卖的前提下，以最低延迟处理最高并发，并优雅降级非购买请求</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>超卖（Overselling）</strong>：实际扣减的库存超过真实库存。在并发场景下，如果「检查库存 → 创建订单 → 扣减库存」不是原子操作，多个请求可能同时通过库存检查，导致超卖。</p>\n<p><strong>预扣（Pre-deduction / Reservation）</strong>：用户点击「购买」时先原子性锁定库存（预扣），然后进行后续的支付流程。若用户最终未支付，预扣的库存在超时后释放。预扣机制将「库存安全」与「支付成功」解耦。</p>\n<p><strong>令牌桶（Token Bucket）</strong>：流量控制算法，系统以固定速率向桶中添加令牌，每次请求消耗一个令牌。桶满则溢出（新令牌丢弃），桶空则拒绝请求。令牌桶允许短暂突发（桶中积累的令牌）。</p>\n<p><strong>漏桶（Leaky Bucket）</strong>：以固定速率处理请求，超过速率的请求进入等待队列。漏桶严格限制输出速率，不允许突发。相比令牌桶更平滑，但响应时间不确定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td>允许突发，平均速率受控</td>\n<td>接口限流（允许瞬时峰值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏桶</td>\n<td>严格恒速，削峰填谷</td>\n<td>消息队列消费速率控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数器（固定窗口）</td>\n<td>实现最简单，有边界效应</td>\n<td>简单 QPS 限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>无边界效应，实现稍复杂</td>\n<td>精确的时间窗口限流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"redis-原子操作防超卖\">Redis 原子操作防超卖</h2><p>防超卖的核心是让「检查库存 + 扣减库存」变成一个不可分割的原子操作。Redis 单线程执行模型天然提供了操作原子性，但需要配合 Lua 脚本来实现复合操作的原子性。</p>\n<p><strong>使用 Lua 脚本实现原子预扣</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- deduct_stock.lua&#10;-- KEYS[1]: 库存 key（如 &quot;stock:seckill:P9876:12345&quot;）&#10;-- ARGV[1]: 购买数量&#10;-- 返回值: 1=成功, 0=库存不足, -1=活动不存在&#10;&#10;local stock = redis.call(&#39;GET&#39;, KEYS[1])&#10;if not stock then&#10;    return -1  -- 活动不存在或已结束&#10;end&#10;&#10;local stockNum = tonumber(stock)&#10;local buyNum = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;&#10;if stockNum &lt; buyNum then&#10;    return 0  -- 库存不足&#10;end&#10;&#10;redis.call(&#39;DECRBY&#39;, KEYS[1], buyNum)&#10;return 1  -- 成功扣减\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- deduct_stock.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[1]: 库存 key（如 \"stock:seckill:P9876:12345\"）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[1]: 购买数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 返回值: 1=成功, 0=库存不足, -1=活动不存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local stock = redis.call('GET', KEYS[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if not stock then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return -1  -- 活动不存在或已结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local stockNum = tonumber(stock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local buyNum = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if stockNum &#x3C; buyNum then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return 0  -- 库存不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('DECRBY', KEYS[1], buyNum)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return 1  -- 成功扣减</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>调用方式（Go 示例）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func PreDeductStock(ctx context.Context, productID, roomID string, quantity int) (bool, error) {&#10;    key := fmt.Sprintf(&quot;stock:seckill:%s:%s&quot;, productID, roomID)&#10;&#10;    result, err := rdb.Eval(ctx, deductStockScript, []string{key}, quantity).Int()&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return false, err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    switch result {&#10;    case 1:&#10;        return true, nil  // 预扣成功&#10;    case 0:&#10;        return false, ErrStockEmpty  // 库存不足&#10;    case -1:&#10;        return false, ErrActivityNotFound&#10;    default:&#10;        return false, ErrUnknown&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PreDeductStock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">productID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">roomID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">quantity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stock:seckill:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, productID, roomID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rdb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Eval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, deductStockScript, []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{key}, quantity).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 预扣成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrStockEmpty  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 库存不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrActivityNotFound</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrUnknown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Redis 库存初始化</strong>：秒杀活动开始前，将库存写入 Redis：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 活动开始前 5 分钟预热&#10;SETNX stock:seckill:P9876:12345 500  // 库存 500 件&#10;EXPIRE stock:seckill:P9876:12345 7200  // 2 小时后自动过期\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 活动开始前 5 分钟预热</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SETNX stock:seckill:P9876:12345 500  // 库存 500 件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXPIRE stock:seckill:P9876:12345 7200  // 2 小时后自动过期</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"秒杀架构-分层削峰\">秒杀架构：分层削峰</h2><p>单靠 Redis 原子操作不足以支撑百万并发——Redis 每秒处理能力约 10-15 万 QPS，而一个头部秒杀的瞬时请求可能超过 100 万 QPS。需要在 Redis 之前构建多层防护：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户点击购买] --&gt;|百万 QPS| B[接入层限流]&#10;    B --&gt;|令牌桶过滤| C[应用层过滤]&#10;    C --&gt;|布隆过滤器/本地缓存| D[Redis 原子扣减]&#10;    D --&gt;|成功扣减| E[异步创建订单]&#10;    D --&gt;|库存不足| F[返回失败]&#10;    E --&gt;|Kafka| G[订单服务]&#10;    G --&gt;|持久化| H[数据库]\">graph TD\n    A[用户点击购买] --&gt;|百万 QPS| B[接入层限流]\n    B --&gt;|令牌桶过滤| C[应用层过滤]\n    C --&gt;|布隆过滤器/本地缓存| D[Redis 原子扣减]\n    D --&gt;|成功扣减| E[异步创建订单]\n    D --&gt;|库存不足| F[返回失败]\n    E --&gt;|Kafka| G[订单服务]\n    G --&gt;|持久化| H[数据库]</pre><p><strong>接入层限流（令牌桶实现）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 基于 Redis 的分布式令牌桶（滑动计数器简化版）&#10;func rateLimitCheck(ctx context.Context, roomID string, limit, windowMs int) (bool, error) {&#10;    now := time.Now().UnixMilli()&#10;    key := fmt.Sprintf(&quot;rate:seckill:%s&quot;, roomID)&#10;    windowStart := now - int64(windowMs)&#10;&#10;    pipe := rdb.TxPipeline()&#10;    // 删除窗口外的记录&#10;    pipe.ZRemRangeByScore(ctx, key, &quot;0&quot;, strconv.FormatInt(windowStart, 10))&#10;    // 统计窗口内请求数&#10;    countCmd := pipe.ZCard(ctx, key)&#10;    // 添加当前请求&#10;    pipe.ZAdd(ctx, key, redis.Z{Score: float64(now), Member: now})&#10;    pipe.Expire(ctx, key, time.Duration(windowMs)*time.Millisecond*2)&#10;&#10;    _, err := pipe.Exec(ctx)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return false, err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return countCmd.Val() &lt; int64(limit), nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于 Redis 的分布式令牌桶（滑动计数器简化版）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rateLimitCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">roomID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-da